  "body": "Currently, there is no rhyme or reason for the ordering of items in the standard. I propose, once we've all agreed on a L1/L2/L3, the following order is used in each sub-section. Sub-sections should exist to group like issues, such as all injections, or all cookies. \r\n\r\nL1/L2/L3\r\nL2/L3\r\nL3 ",
